; First light: a 20 mm square at 10 % power
; generated by Maker Connect example generator
; GRBL 1.1 laser, laser mode on ($32=1), power range S0-1000 ($30=1000).
; Positions are absolute, in mm, from the machine origin after homing ($H).
; Try it on scrap cardboard or plywood, wear the goggles, stay at the machine.
; Square from X10 Y10 to X30 Y30.
; estimated printing time (normal mode) = 0m 8s
G21 ; millimetres
G90 ; absolute
M5 ; laser off
; frame: the outline with the laser off, so you see where it goes
G0 X10 Y10 F3000
G0 X30 Y10
G0 X30 Y30
G0 X10 Y30
G0 X10 Y10
; the square at 10 % power, 1000 mm/min
M4 S0 ; dynamic power, off while not moving
G1 X30 Y10 S100 F1000
G1 X30 Y30 S100 F1000
G1 X10 Y30 S100 F1000
G1 X10 Y10 S100 F1000
M5 ; laser off
G0 X10 Y10
